# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit the real .env — it's already in .gitignore for the
# Supabase keys from the earlier backend design; add these alongside them.

# Vercel serverless functions read this for src/services/extraction (Phase 1) — image/PDF
# reading (vision-client.ts). This is a SEPARATE Gemini key from GEMINI_API_KEY below, which
# is used by the AI planning assistant elsewhere in the app. Keeping them separate means a
# heavy folder scan (site photos, PDFs) never eats into the assistant's quota, and vice versa.
# Previously this was GROQ_API_KEY (Groq/Qwen) — replaced due to Groq's low rate limits.
GEMINI_EXTRACTION_API_KEY=

# Optional override — defaults to gemini-2.5-flash in vision-client.ts if unset.
# GEMINI_EXTRACTION_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
# From the earlier backend design session — add these too if not already present.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_KEY=
#GEMINI_API_KEY=
#GEMINI_REPLAN_MODEL=